  <編章節>   Chapter 6 Supplementary Provisions</編章節>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 36</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Regulations pertaining to registration, certification and tax collection as set forth in this Act shall be prescribed by the MOF.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 37</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[This Act shall come into force from the date of promulgation, while the implementation of the amendments made to Articles 3, 5, 13 through 15, 17, 18 and 32, which were promulgated on May 7, 1997; and the amendments made to Article 12 which was promulgated on October 31, 2001, and the Articles which were amended on August 5, 2025, shall come into force when determined by the Executive Yuan.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
